Petition No. 16370 of 2023 along with 13 other petitions [Jagannath Vishnu Pawar vs. Union of India through Deputy Secretary, Ministry of Shipping Road Transport and Highway and others]
(supra) in terms of the following order:-:
ORDER (i) The petitioners shall furnish copy of their respective award to the Competent Authority/Special Land Acquisition Officer within a period of two weeks from the date of uploading of this order for the purpose of computation of the amount of solatium and interest as may be payable to the petitioners in terms of what has been held by the Supreme Court in Union of India and others Vs. Tarsem Singh and others (supra);
